{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "5c7e2a4f-9b1d-4e6a-8c3f-2d5b7a9e1f4c",
		"name": "TaxVision - Notes",
		"description": "Coleccion del microservicio Notes de TaxVision (notas del staff, asociables polimorficamente a Customer/Task/Appointment/SignatureRequest/etc). Usa el environment TaxVisionBackEnd (UrlBase apunta al Gateway). Dos arcos: NotesController (staff, [AllowActorTypes(TenantEmployee,TenantAdmin,PlatformAdmin)], {{accessToken}} de un login humano normal) y PortalNotesController ([AllowActorTypes(CustomerPortal)], solo lectura de notas ClientVisible, requiere un accessToken de login de portal — no incluido en este environment por default). TenantId/UserId siempre del JWT, nunca de body/query. Ver ADR_018_Notes_Bounded_Context.md y README.md #47 para el detalle completo (permisos, rate limiting, autorizacion de 5 capas, adjuntos via CloudStorage Caso B). 15 endpoints, verificados endpoint por endpoint contra los controllers reales en el cierre de Fase 10.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Notas (staff)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Create",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" },
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes" ]
						},
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"html\": \"<p>Llamar al cliente manana para revisar documentos.</p>\",\n  \"targetType\": \"Customer\",\n  \"targetId\": \"{{customerId}}\",\n  \"visibility\": \"Team\",\n  \"colorKind\": \"FollowUp\"\n}"
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.manage. TargetType=None + TargetId=null para una nota personal (my-planner). Visibilidad default del dominio es Private si se omite; el frontend sugiere Team para notas sobre un Customer. Validacion del Customer referenciado es SOFT (nunca bloquea por lag de proyeccion)."
					},
					"response": [],
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"status 201\", () => pm.response.code === 201);",
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"  const body = pm.response.json();",
									"  pm.environment.set(\"notesNoteId\", body.id);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "GetById",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/{{notesNoteId}}",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "{{notesNoteId}}" ]
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.read. Devuelve 404 uniforme tanto si la nota no existe como si existe pero no es visible para el actor (Private de otro sin notes.view_all) — nunca revela la existencia de una nota que no puede ver."
					},
					"response": [],
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"status 200 or 404 (cross-tenant/no-visible)\", () => [200, 404].includes(pm.response.code));"
								]
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "ListByReference",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes?targetType=Customer&targetId={{customerId}}&page=1&size=20",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes" ],
							"query": [
								{ "key": "targetType", "value": "Customer" },
								{ "key": "targetId", "value": "{{customerId}}" },
								{ "key": "page", "value": "1" },
								{ "key": "size", "value": "20" }
							]
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.read. Filtro de visibilidad (Private ajena requiere notes.view_all) empujado a SQL, nunca filtrado en memoria post-pagina."
					},
					"response": [],
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.code === 200);"
								]
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Mine",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/mine?page=1&size=20",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "mine" ],
							"query": [
								{ "key": "page", "value": "1" },
								{ "key": "size", "value": "20" }
							]
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.read. Sin filtro de visibilidad extra — el autor siempre ve las suyas. Rate limit notes.f.list (300/60s)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Search",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/search?q=cliente&page=1&size=20",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "search" ],
							"query": [
								{ "key": "q", "value": "cliente" },
								{ "key": "page", "value": "1" },
								{ "key": "size", "value": "20" }
							]
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.read. Busqueda simple SQL sobre ContentPreview (sin full-text en v1). Rate limit notes.h.search (categoria H, 20/60s, mas estricto que un GET normal)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "UpdateContent",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" },
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/{{notesNoteId}}/content",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "{{notesNoteId}}", "content" ]
						},
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"html\": \"<p>Llamada realizada, cliente confirmo la reunion.</p>\"\n}"
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.manage. Estrictamente el autor (Capa 3b/Fase 9 defensa en profundidad via IsOwnerOrHasManageHandler<Note> cuando Authorization:ResourceOwnership:Enabled=true) — ni siquiera notes.view_all permite editar contenido ajeno. 403 (Note.Forbidden) si no es el autor."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "ChangeVisibility",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" },
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/{{notesNoteId}}/visibility",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "{{notesNoteId}}", "visibility" ]
						},
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"visibility\": \"ClientVisible\"\n}"
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.manage. Solo el autor. ClientVisible es la unica visibilidad que el CustomerPortal puede leer (ver PortalNotesController.ListClientVisible)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Pin",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/{{notesNoteId}}/pin",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "{{notesNoteId}}", "pin" ]
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.manage. Solo el autor. Rate limit notes.g.write (categoria G, 60/60s)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Unpin",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/{{notesNoteId}}/unpin",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "{{notesNoteId}}", "unpin" ]
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.manage. Solo el autor."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "SetColor",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" },
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/{{notesNoteId}}/color",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "{{notesNoteId}}", "color" ]
						},
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"colorKind\": \"Important\"\n}"
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.manage. Solo el autor. colorKind=null quita el color."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Archive",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/{{notesNoteId}}/archive",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "{{notesNoteId}}", "archive" ]
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.manage a nivel de Capa 1 (la tabla del plan dice \"notes.manage o notes.view_all\" pero [HasPermission] no expresa OR); el OR real (autor o notes.view_all) se resuelve dentro del handler via NoteVisibilityPolicy.CanManage."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Restore",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/{{notesNoteId}}/restore",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "{{notesNoteId}}", "restore" ]
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.manage (o notes.view_all via el handler, ver Archive)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Delete",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/{{notesNoteId}}",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "{{notesNoteId}}" ]
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.manage (o notes.view_all via el handler). Soft-delete terminal — status Deleted, oculto salvo governance (notes.view_all)."
					},
					"response": [],
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"status 204 or documented error\", () => [204, 403, 404].includes(pm.response.code));"
								]
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "AttachFile",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" },
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/{{notesNoteId}}/attachments",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "{{notesNoteId}}", "attachments" ]
						},
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"cloudStorageFileId\": \"<guid del fileId ya subido a CloudStorage por el navegador>\",\n  \"displayName\": \"contrato.pdf\",\n  \"contentType\": \"application/pdf\",\n  \"sizeBytes\": 245678\n}"
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.manage. Solo el autor. Caso B (ADR-07): el navegador ya subio el archivo directo a CloudStorage con SU JWT antes de llamar este endpoint — Notes nunca habla con MinIO. El adjunto queda en estado Pending hasta que el consumer de FileAvailable/Infected/BlockedByPolicy lo mueva a Available/Rejected."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "DetachFile",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/{{notesNoteId}}/attachments/{{notesFileId}}",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "{{notesNoteId}}", "attachments", "{{notesFileId}}" ]
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.manage. Solo el autor. Soft: mueve el adjunto a Detached, no lo remueve de la coleccion. El borrado de bytes se difiere a la retencion de CloudStorage. Publica notes.attachment_detached.v1."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Portal (CustomerPortal)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "ListClientVisible",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}", "type": "text" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{UrlBase}}/notes/portal?targetType=Customer&targetId={{customerId}}&page=1&size=20",
							"host": [ "{{UrlBase}}" ],
							"path": [ "notes", "portal" ],
							"query": [
								{ "key": "targetType", "value": "Customer" },
								{ "key": "targetId", "value": "{{customerId}}" },
								{ "key": "page", "value": "1" },
								{ "key": "size", "value": "20" }
							]
						},
						"description": "Requiere notes.portal.read + AllowActorTypes(CustomerPortal) — el accessToken debe venir de un login de portal, no de staff. Solo ve notas Visibility=ClientVisible; nunca Team/Private/Deleted. El portal NUNCA crea ni edita notas (403 en cualquier intento contra NotesController, que exige TenantEmployee/TenantAdmin/PlatformAdmin). Rate limit notes.f.portal_read (300/60s)."
					},
					"response": [],
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.code === 200);",
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"  const body = pm.response.json();",
									"  pm.test(\"only ClientVisible notes\", () => (body.items || []).every(n => n.visibility === 'ClientVisible'));",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}
